{"meta":{"id":"career","category":"portfolio","title":"경력 요약 및 프로젝트 기술서","subtitle":"","summary":"총 경력 약 7년 — 공공 빅데이터 분석 서버(FastAPI·DuckDB·Parquet), 대민 알림 배치(Spring·전자정부·MyBatis), 웹 보안, IoT 모니터링, 디스플레이 비전 검사(C++ MFC·OpenCV), AI 에이전트 협업 체계","tags":["java","spring","fastapi","python","postgresql","oracle","duckdb","parquet","redis","docker","c++","mfc","opencv","ai","성능"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"portfolio","updatedAt":"2026-11-07"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\">\r\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>PORTFOLIO\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-11-07</span>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">경력 요약 및 프로젝트 기술서</h1>\r\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\">\r\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\r\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\r\n    </svg>\r\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\r\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 총 경력 약 7년 1개월 (SW 개발 약 5년 10개월) — 공공 빅데이터 플랫폼 분석 서버(FastAPI·DuckDB·Parquet), 대민 알림 배치(Spring·전자정부·MyBatis), 웹 애플리케이션 보안, IoT SCADA, 디스플레이 비전 자동화(C++ MFC·OpenCV), AI 에이전트 협업 체계\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">전문 분야 및 프로필 요약</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">상세 내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">전문 분야</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">웹 백엔드 시스템 개발, 대용량 데이터 처리 파이프라인, AI 작업 체계/컨텍스트 엔지니어링, 장비 비전/시스템 SW</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">총 경력</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">약 7년 1개월 (SW 개발 약 5년 10개월)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">핵심 기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Java / Spring Boot</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>Python / FastAPI</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>PostgreSQL / DuckDB / Parquet</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>C++ MFC / OpenCV</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>Docker / Linux</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>AI Context Engineering</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">포트폴리오 및 대외 공개용</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">1. 경력 개요 (Career Overview)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">기간</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">회사 / 조직</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">역할 / 직위</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">주요 개발 분야 및 담당 업무</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>2025.07 ~ 현재</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>공공 SW 개발사 (현 재직)</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">개발본부 / 선임연구원</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">공공 빅데이터 플랫폼 고도화, Python 분석 마이크로서비스 및 대용량 데이터 처리 파이프라인 구축, 행정 연계 알림 배치 시스템 개발</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2023.12 ~ 2024.02</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">국비 교육과정</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">백엔드 과정 수료</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Spring MVC, 서블릿/JSP, Java 기반 웹 풀스택 프로젝트 (팀 프로젝트 및 아키텍처 리딩)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2023.06 ~ 2023.11</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">IoT 솔루션 기업</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">연구소 / 선임연구원</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">IoT 센서 데이터 모니터링 시스템(SCADA) 및 서버 구축 (PHP, MySQL, Apache)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2021.10 ~ 2023.05</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">디스플레이 검사장비 기업</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">선행개발팀 / 선임연구원</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">커브드 디스플레이 무인 자동 검사 비전 시스템 개발 (C++ MFC, OpenCV, C#)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2019.09 ~ 2021.09</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">레이저 가공장비 기업</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">생산기술팀 / 사원</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">레이저 가공 장비 CAD(DXF) 엔티티 파싱, 비전 정합 및 모션 제어 SW 개발 (C++ MFC, OpenCV, OpenGL)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2018.06 ~ 2019.09</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">통신 기술지원 기업</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">고객2파트 / 사원</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">방송/통신 네트워크 기술 상담 및 장애 대응</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2. 주요 실무 프로젝트 (Key Projects)</h2></div><div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-3\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n      <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono\">P1</span>\r\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-stone-900\">공공 빅데이터 플랫폼 분석 서버 및 고도화</h3>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">수행 기간</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2026.02 ~ 현재</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소속 / 기여도</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">현 회사 / 백엔드 및 데이터 분석 서버 아키텍처 설계 및 개발 (기여도 100%)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Python 3.12</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>FastAPI</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Flask</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>PostgreSQL</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>DuckDB</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Parquet</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Polars</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Redis</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Docker</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Plotly</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 pt-1\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>대용량 데이터 처리 벤치마크 및 저장소 최적화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 1,100만 건 이상 대용량 소방/구급 데이터 로딩 성능 시험 수행</p><p>• PostgreSQL 대비 <strong class='text-stone-900'>Parquet</strong> 도입으로 로딩 속도 <strong class='text-stone-900'>5~380배 향상</strong> 실증 및 스토리지 공간 <strong class='text-stone-900'>1/14 압축</strong> 달성</p><p>• Polars 스트리밍 지연 연산(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>sink_parquet</code>)과 청크 단위 처리를 통해 대용량 변환 중 메모리 부족(OOM) 방지 파이프라인 구축</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>분석 마이크로서비스 컨테이너화 및 리소스 관리\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• Docker(Python slim) 기반 분석 서버 컨테이너화 및 독립 가상환경 분리 배포</p><p>• Redis를 통한 무거운 통계 분석 결과 비동기 캐싱 및 작업 락(Lock) 구현으로 다중 동시 요청 시 리소스 경합 및 충돌 방지</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>동적 인터랙티브 시각화 파이프라인\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• Plotly 기반 통계 차트 동적 렌더링 파이프라인 개발 (동적 필터링, 버블 차트, 상위 N개 외 자동 '기타' 그룹화 지원)</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-3\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n      <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono\">P2</span>\r\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-stone-900\">대민 알림 서비스 및 행정 데이터 연계 고도화</h3>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">수행 기간</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2025.07 ~ 2025.12</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소속 / 기여도</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">현 회사 / 백엔드 비즈니스 로직 및 스케줄러 배치 개발 (기여도 100%)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Java 8/11</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Spring Framework</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>전자정부프레임워크 3.8</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>MyBatis</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Oracle</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>WebSquare</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 pt-1\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>스케줄러 기반 자동 알림 발송 파이프라인 구축\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 국민비서 플랫폼 연계 대민 안내 메시지 자동 발송 배치 서비스 구축</p><p>• 서버별 시차 실행, 중복 발송 방지 키 검증, 네트워크/외부 통신 장애 시 재발송 처리 매커니즘 구현</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>복잡한 비즈니스 룰 및 쿼리 최적화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 업무 판정 로직을 복잡한 계층 쿼리(CTE, 윈도우 함수, 집계 후 결합)로 최적화하여 DB 단에서 일괄 처리</p><p>• 날짜 변환 오류(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>DEFAULT NULL ON CONVERSION ERROR</code>) 방어 코드 및 법정 공휴일 자동 전개(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>CONNECT BY</code>) 로직 구현</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>보안 및 개인정보 보호 강화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 대상자 개인 식별 정보 단방향/양방향 암호화 처리 및 인터셉터 보안 적용</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-3\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n      <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono\">P3</span>\r\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-stone-900\">웹 애플리케이션 보안 아키텍처 구축</h3>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">수행 기간</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2026.04 ~ 2026.07</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소속 / 역할</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">현 회사 / 백엔드 보안 아키텍처 설계 및 구현</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Java</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Spring Framework</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>PostgreSQL</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Linux</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 pt-1\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>세션 보안 강화 및 하이재킹 방어\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 동시 세션 탈취 및 비정상 접근 탐지 로직 구현, 세션 하이재킹 발생 시 기존 사용자 세션 복구 체계 마련</p><p>• 세션 ID 무단 복제 사용 차단, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>HttpOnly</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Secure</code> 쿠키 정책 강제 적용</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>자동화 공격 방어 시스템\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 신뢰된 프론트엔드 서버만 API를 호출하도록 검증하는 서명 키 및 요청 해시 검증 인터셉터 구현</p><p>• 매크로 및 비정상적 반복 요청 차단과 자동 강제 로그아웃 조치로 API 남용 차단</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-3\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n      <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono\">P4</span>\r\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-stone-900\">IoT 센서 데이터 모니터링 시스템 (SCADA) 구축</h3>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">수행 기간</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2023.06 ~ 2023.11</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소속 / 역할</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">IoT 솔루션 기업 / 웹 모니터링 서버 풀스택 개발 및 호스팅 인프라 구축</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>PHP</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>MySQL</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Apache</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Bootstrap</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>dygraph</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Linux NAS</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 pt-1\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>시계열 데이터 실시간 수집 및 적재\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• IoT 장비 및 센서로부터 유입되는 시계열 데이터의 실시간 수집 및 MySQL 데이터베이스 적재 파이프라인 개발</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>웹 기반 실시간 시계열 대시보드\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• dygraph 및 Chart 라이브러리를 활용하여 웹 브라우저 기반 대용량 센서 데이터 실시간 시계열 차트 구현</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>호스팅 인프라 및 운영 환경 세팅\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 사내 Linux NAS 장비 기반 Apache 웹 서버 구축, 외부 도메인 포워딩 및 접근 로그 모니터링 환경 세팅</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-3\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n      <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono\">P5</span>\r\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-stone-900\">디스플레이 검사 및 레이저 가공 비전 자동화 시스템</h3>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">수행 기간</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2019.09 ~ 2023.05</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소속 / 역할</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">디스플레이 · 레이저 장비 기업 / 장비 제어 및 비전 알고리즘 엔지니어</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기술 스택</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>C++ MFC</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>OpenCV 3.2</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>OpenGL</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Win32 API</code> <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>다축 모션 스테이지</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 pt-1\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>OLED 커브드 디스플레이 무인 자동 검사 비전 시스템\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• 카메라 광학계 세팅(반사광/비침 억제) 및 서브픽셀 단위 고정밀 에지/마크 검출 알고리즘 적용</p><p>• IO 통신 기반 검사 공정 인터락 제어 및 무인 자동화 검사 라인 구축</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1.5\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>CAD DXF 도면 파싱 및 레이저 가공 비전 정합기\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\">\r\n    <p>• AutoCAD DXF 도면 파일 바이너리/텍스트 파싱을 통한 형상 엔티티 추출 및 가공 궤적 변환 알고리즘 개발</p><p>• OpenGL 기반 3D 가공 궤적 렌더링 및 <strong class='text-stone-900'>15개 작업자 스레드 격자 분할 병렬 렌더링</strong> 기법 적용으로 UI 응답성 극대화</p><p>• Windows 공유 메모리(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>CreateFileMapping</code>)를 통한 프로세스 간 초고속 영상 데이터 IPC 구현</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">3. 엔지니어링 및 AI 생산성 체계화</h2></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1 my-2\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>지식 베이스(aide) 및 AGENTS 규칙 체계 구축\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\"><p>• AI 코딩 어시스턴트(Claude Code, Antigravity 등)가 대규모 프로젝트에서 일관된 컨텍스트와 도메인 규칙을 준수하도록 하는 규칙·모듈 지식 베이스 설계</p><p>• 단계별 태그 인덱스 및 상시 규칙 시스템(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>AGENTS.md</code>)을 표준화하여 모델의 환각(Hallucination) 억제 및 컨텍스트 주입 최적화</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1 my-2\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>프롬프트 엔지니어링 및 A/B 테스트 기반 신뢰성 검증\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\"><p>• 프롬프트를 시스템 정의와 입력 데이터로 엄격히 분리하고, 엄격한 JSON 스키마(<strong class='text-stone-900'>Structured Outputs</strong>) 강제</p><p>• 동일 과제 반복 테스트 및 정답 대조 체계를 통해 AI 생성 코드 및 데이터의 신뢰성 검증 체계 운영</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/80 border border-stone-200/80 space-y-1 my-2\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>자체 AI 로그 및 사용량 분석 도구 개발\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 space-y-1\"><p>• AI 사용 로그(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>usage.db</code>)를 파싱하여 모델별 토큰 사용량, 행동 패턴, 세션 흐름을 자체 집계·시각화하는 분석 도구(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>AiMng</code>) 직접 구현</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">4. 핵심 역량 및 업무 강점</h2></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1 my-2 shadow-xs\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>1. 대용량 데이터 및 DB 성능 최적화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">RDBMS(Oracle, PostgreSQL) 쿼리 튜닝은 물론, 분석 워크로드에 맞춘 최신 컬럼형 스토리지(DuckDB, Parquet) 도입을 통해 극적인 성능 향상을 도출합니다.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1 my-2 shadow-xs\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>2. 복잡한 비즈니스 로직의 명확한 구조화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">공공·행정 규정 등 복잡하게 얽힌 업무 요구사항을 분석하여 DB 프로시저/쿼리와 애플리케이션 계층 간에 명확히 역할을 배분하고 견고하게 구현합니다.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1 my-2 shadow-xs\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>3. 탄탄한 시스템 바닥 경험과 문제 해결력\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">하드웨어/임베디드 제어(C/C++, 메모리 직접 제어, 멀티스레드, 소켓/IPC)에서 출발하여 웹 풀스택 및 클라우드 환경까지 경험하여, 네트워크/메모리/OS 레벨의 근본적인 원인을 정확히 추적합니다.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1 my-2 shadow-xs\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>4. AI 도구의 체계적 통제 및 엔지니어링 극대화\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">AI를 단순 질문용 도구가 아닌 표준화된 규칙, 컨텍스트 주입, 자체 파이프라인으로 제어하여 고품질 소프트웨어를 신속하고 안정적으로 구축합니다.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"portfolio/career","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"portfolio","title":"포트폴리오","path":"portfolio"}],"hasImage":false}